; Room Shapes #N$09 and #N$0A Lines
;
; The lines that join the corners of the frame of room shapes #N$09 and
; #N$0A (see #R$A982). Each list has the corner to start from, followed by the
; corners to draw lines to, and ends with #N$FF. The last byte is #N$FF to end
; all of the lists. The corners are in #R$BED0 for shape #N$09 and #R$BE54 for
; shape #N$0A.
@label=RoomShapes_09_0A_Lines
b$BD7E DEFB $00,$17,$01,$04,$FF ; Start at corner #N$00 and draw lines to corners #N$17, #N$01 and
                                ; #N$04.
